            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to the original Cyberpunk VR experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TECHNOLUST</i> is the award-winning Oculus Rift launch title that defined early VR cyberpunk. This rerelease makes the original classic available again—fully playable on PC with <strong>mouse &amp; keyboard or any Xbox-compatible gamepad</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully realized neon-soaked dystopia as an interactive visual novel brought to life through atmospheric environments, strange characters, A.I. uprisings, mass conspiracies, and the crushing weight of corporate control. Winner of <strong>2 Proto Awards (Best Art Direction, Best Sound Design)</strong> and a <strong>Vision Award for Artistic Achievement</strong>, <i>TECHNOLUST</i> remains a cult favorite for fans of retro-future immersion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You’re Getting in This Release</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version is the <strong>original 2016 Oculus Rift edition</strong>, restored and updated for modern PCs but <strong>does not include motion-controller support</strong>. It plays like a traditional first-person adventure using a controller or mouse and keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remaster in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully remastered edition</strong> of <i>TECHNOLUST</i> is currently in production, featuring:<br>• <strong>Full SteamVR support</strong><br>• <strong>Native desktop (non-VR) mode</strong><br>• <strong>Steam Deck compatibility</strong><br>• <strong>Reworked visuals &amp; upgraded systems</strong><br>• <strong>Integrated expansion content</strong><br>• <strong>Motion-controller support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This rerelease exists for players who want to revisit—or discover—the <strong>original version</strong> while the new edition is being completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRUST YOUR TECHNOLUST.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to the original Cyberpunk VR experience.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TECHNOLUST</i> is the award-winning Oculus Rift launch title that defined early VR cyberpunk. This rerelease makes the original classic available again—fully playable on PC with <strong>mouse &amp; keyboard or any Xbox-compatible gamepad</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fully realized neon-soaked dystopia as an interactive visual novel brought to life through atmospheric environments, strange characters, A.I. uprisings, mass conspiracies, and the crushing weight of corporate control. Winner of <strong>2 Proto Awards (Best Art Direction, Best Sound Design)</strong> and a <strong>Vision Award for Artistic Achievement</strong>, <i>TECHNOLUST</i> remains a cult favorite for fans of retro-future immersion.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What You’re Getting in This Release</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This version is the <strong>original 2016 Oculus Rift edition</strong>, restored and updated for modern PCs but <strong>does not include motion-controller support</strong>. It plays like a traditional first-person adventure using a controller or mouse and keyboard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Remaster in Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>fully remastered edition</strong> of <i>TECHNOLUST</i> is currently in production, featuring:<br>• <strong>Full SteamVR support</strong><br>• <strong>Native desktop (non-VR) mode</strong><br>• <strong>Steam Deck compatibility</strong><br>• <strong>Reworked visuals &amp; upgraded systems</strong><br>• <strong>Integrated expansion content</strong><br>• <strong>Motion-controller support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This rerelease exists for players who want to revisit—or discover—the <strong>original version</strong> while the new edition is being completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRUST YOUR TECHNOLUST.</strong></p>",
